# Internal working documents. README.md is the only markdown that ships, so
# these must never reach the public repo.
#
# Match by directory and by pattern, not by exact path. The previous rules
# named /PLAN.md and /REVIEW.md; once those files moved under docs/ the rules
# silently matched nothing, leaving ~200 KB of internal review material one
# `git add -A` away from being published.
/docs/
/PLAN.md
/REVIEW.md
*SLOP_REVIEW*.md
